wmfd-de
=======

Overview
--------

  'wmfd-de' builds a toolchain suitable for generating custom boot
floppy images for FreeDOS.

  The build system is intended to be flexible, with a project-level
configuration specifying both toolchain and image content.

  To build a simple demonstration floppy image, run:
	make PROJECT_CONFIG=config/project/wmfd-2o.mk deploy-media
